      "findings": "No post-harvest production or total harvest mass features are present as predictors. Features are strictly pedo-climatic conditions knowable at sowing time."
    },
    "spatial_leakage": {
      "status": "CAUTION IDENTIFIED",
      "findings": "There are 10091 unique coordinate locations across 10091 observations (average 1.0 seasons/years per coordinates). In standard random K-fold splits, the exact same geographic coordinates can appear in both training and test sets. V4 addresses this explicitly via Leave-State-Out, Leave-Region-Out, and Spatiotemporal Holdout."
    },
    "temporal_leakage": {
      "status": "CAUTION IDENTIFIED",
      "findings": "Standard random splitting allows 2020 records into training while evaluating on 2018 records. V4 addresses this via forward temporal validation (Train: <= 2017, Val: 2018, Test: 2019-2020) and strict Unseen Region + Future Year spatiotemporal holdout."
    }
  }
